// подсказки (HelpWindow справа) и заголовки разделов
FOV_Help Camera field of view. Wider shows more at the sides, but everything looks smaller.
StaticCrosshairSize_Help Crosshair size when the custom-sized crosshair is on.
FlashbangBrightness_Help How strongly a flashbang blinds you.
CameraShakeIntensity_Help Strength of camera shake from explosions and shots.
DamageFlinchIntensity_Help How much the camera jerks when you take damage.
Debug_Toggle_Help FPS counter and ping in the corner of the screen.
Gore_Toggle_Help Blood splatters and stains on hits.
Filter_Toggle_Help Hides profanity in chat. Hate speech is always hidden, even with the filter off.
Chat_Text_Toggle_Help Show other players' messages in text chat.
Chat_Voice_In_Toggle_Help Hear other players' voice chat.
Chat_Voice_Out_Toggle_Help Allow speaking in game through your microphone.
VoiceAlwaysRecording_Help Between phrases the microphone is muted instead of stopped, so the start and end of phrases are not cut off.
ShowOutboundVoiceChatOffHint_Help An icon on screen when your microphone is off.
Hints_Toggle_Help Tool key hints in the map editor.
Streamer_Toggle_Help Hides other players' names and avatars so they are not shown on stream.
Pause_When_Unfocused_Help Opens the pause menu when you alt-tab. The server keeps running.
Nametag_Fade_Out_Help Group members' name tags fade near the crosshair so they do not get in the way of aiming.
ScreenshotSupersampling_Help Screenshots at double resolution: cleaner edges, but taking one takes longer.
UseStaticCrosshair_Help A fixed-size crosshair instead of one that changes with weapon spread.
CrosshairShape_Help Crosshair look: lines or classic.
Metric_Help Units for distance and speed.
Hitmarker_Help Where to show the hit marker: on the crosshair or at the hit point.
HitmarkerStyle_Help Hit marker look: animated or classic.
VehicleThirdPersonCameraMode_Help Third-person camera in ground vehicles: free or turning with the vehicle.
AircraftThirdPersonCameraMode_Help Third-person camera in aircraft: free or turning with the aircraft.
DamageFlinchMode_Help How the camera flinches when hit: roll only, or toward where the damage came from.
